<div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/General_Chemistry/Exercises:_General_Chemistry/Exercises:_Brown_et_al./02.E:_Atoms_Molecules_and_Ions_(Exercises)" class="mt-section" id="section_25"><span id="Conceptual_Problems_6"></span><h4 class="editable">Conceptual Problems</h4>

<p>1. What are the differences and similarities between a polyatomic ion and a molecule?</p>

<p>2. Classify each compound as ionic or covalent.</p>

<ol start="1" style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
    <li>Zn<sub>3</sub>(PO<sub>4</sub>)<sub>2</sub></li>
