    <li>K<sub>2</sub>Cr<sub>2</sub>O<sub>7</sub></li>
    <li>CH<sub>3</sub>CH<sub>2</sub>SH</li>
    <li>NH<sub>4</sub>Br</li>
    <li>CCl<sub>2</sub>F<sub>2</sub></li>
</ol>

<p>3. Classify each compound as ionic or covalent. Which are organic compounds and which are inorganic compounds?</p>

<ol start="1" style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
    <li>CH<sub>3</sub>CH<sub>2</sub>CO<sub>2</sub>H</li>
